  "lineage": "Music, song and dance of the Tagbana community of Afounkaha in central Côte d'Ivoire, proclaimed a UNESCO Masterpiece of the Oral and Intangible Heritage in 2001 and inscribed on the Representative List in 2008. Transverse horns of different sizes, covered with cowhide, sound phrases that a women's chorus translates into words, while drummers beat time; a generic horn card stands in for the gbofe horns and a generic drum for the drums.",
